OL,3,GNEWSAInquest finds no road or vehicle
OL,4,Adefects in fatal A5 crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inquest into the death of three
OL,7,Fpeople on the A5 road near Aughnacloy
OL,8,Fhas heard the minibus they were
OL,9,Ftravelling in veered on to the wrong
OL,10,Fside of the road.
OL,12,FDan McKane, his sister Christine McKane
OL,13,Fand their aunt Julia McSorley were
OL,14,Fkilled when the minibus was in a
OL,15,Fcollision with a lorry on the A5
OL,16,FTullyvar Road on 27 April 2023.
OL,18,FThe inquest heard the vehicles involved
OL,19,Fwere in good working order and there
OL,20,Fwere no defects in the road.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,418,410,260,120,0,100
